Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:17:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 35/35] feat: a space's right-click menu takes items from other
 mods (spaces.menu), opened as a popup with the space, its folder and machine

Like the agents list's agents.menu: shared "spaces.menu" = { <mod>: { at, items: [{ id, label, labels?, width?, height?, props? }] } }; labels gives a space its own label. scripts/menu.test.ts, in just test.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
